/target/
# Cargo.lock IS committed — this workspace ships a binary (`rustydnsd`)
# and we want reproducible builds + supply-chain visibility. Per Rust
# convention only library-only workspaces ignore the lock.
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# Operator-local deployment artifacts — created in-place by the Docker and
# systemd quick-starts. Your live rustydns.toml encodes your environment
# (per-client policy IPs, internal hostnames in rewrites); keep it out of
# version control. Force-add explicitly if you truly intend to publish one.
/rustydns.toml
/mesh/
/blocklists/
